    <h1>Refund Policy</h1>
    <p><strong>Last updated: June 2026</strong></p>

    <p>Better Credit Guide sells an instantly delivered digital educational PDF guide. Because the product is delivered electronically and can be accessed immediately after purchase, all sales are generally final once the file has been accessed or downloaded.</p>

    <h2>Digital Product Delivery</h2>
    <p>After purchase, customers receive access to download the PDF guide through the confirmation page and/or email delivery. It is the customer’s responsibility to save the file after downloading it.</p>

    <h2>When Refunds May Be Considered</h2>
    <p>We may review refund requests in limited situations, including:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Duplicate charges for the same purchase;</li>
      <li>Technical issues that prevent access to the purchased file and cannot be resolved by support;</li>
      <li>Accidental purchase requests submitted before the file has been accessed or downloaded.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>No Guaranteed Credit Outcomes</h2>
    <p>Better Credit Guide is an educational resource only. We are not a credit repair company, law firm, financial advisor, lender, or credit bureau. We do not guarantee credit score increases, credit report changes, removals, approvals, financing, or any specific outcome.</p>

    <h2>How to Request Help</h2>
    <p>If you have trouble accessing your guide, please contact support with your order reference and purchase email. We will attempt to help you access the file or re-send access when appropriate.</p>

    <h2>Refund Processing</h2>
    <p>If a refund is approved, it will be processed back to the original payment method through Stripe. Your bank or card issuer may take several business days to post the refund.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>For questions about this Refund Policy, please contact our support team.</p>
